Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyRoadObstacle" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :roadObject1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :foggy1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:roadObject1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Fallen tree blocking the roadway" .

:foggy1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "High probability of collision due to road obstruction in low visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: High probability of collision due to road obstruction in low visibility
Severity Score: 0.95